what could be more powerful than a god  goku's son gohan found a way to once  again surpass his dad in dragon ball  super superhero longtime fans of the  dragon ball franchise have seen power  levels go from simple strength and speed  enhancements to almost world-ending  destructive forces vegeta what did you  say his power level is  it's over 9 000.  near the start of the original dragon  ball series the young goku accidentally  taps into the cataclysmic power of his  saiyan nature by transforming into a  giant bloodthirsty ape this form is  known as uzaru and although it provides  incredible strength all logic and  reasoning go out the window it's this  ability that enables alien saiyans to  attack and subjugate other species  expanding their universe spanning empire  even the very youngest of saiyans can  lay waste to entire worlds by simple  exposure to moonlight goku doesn't share  the world conquering hunger of his  fellow saiyans but he does share their  love of intense combat eventually goku  starts his own family and his firstborn  son is gohan young gohan at first doubts  his powers because of his half-human  half-saiyan blood but it is soon  revealed that his power can dwarf even  that of goku when gohan absolutely  trounces cell at the end of the cell  saga since then gohan has unlocked even  greater power during the final saga of  dragon ball z gohan trained with old kai  to unlock a new ability he learns that  saiyan's channel and wastes a tremendous  amount of power while transforming into  the various super saiyan forms but old  kai's technique taught gohan to access  the enhanced speed and strength of a  super saiyan without the waist  incredible he's stronger than he ever  was as a super saiyan but he looks like  he hasn't changed a bit gohan stands toe  to toe with the malevolent entity known  as super boo but he eventually retires  from fighting to instead focus on his  home life and burgeoning family his  combat prowess begins to fade from his  lack of training but the new movie  dragon ball super superhero sees the  spotlight casts back onto gohan and his  childhood mentor piccolo the movie kicks  off with a reconstituted red ribbon army  seeking vengeance against piccolo and  gohan with a plan to kidnap gohan's  daughter to lure him into a trap and  unleash the devastation of the killer  android cell max piccolo and gohan gets  some rather potent power upgrades during  the course of the film piccolo uses the  power of the dragon balls to unlock his  orange form which grants him tremendous  fighting abilities yet even with his  enhanced power piccolo falls to sell max  and as in the past seeing a friend get  hurt leads gohan to tap into previously  unseen powers of his own gohan unlocks a  new power level called gohan beast which  resembles a super saiyan 2 look the key  differences are that his hair is silver  instead of yellow and his eyes turn red  his aura is augmented with red arcing  lightning bolts that's herman crackle  with power in this form gohan is easily  able to defeat the powerful villain  gohan once again catapulting to the  upper echelons of power among the z  fighters is such a momentous event that  series creator akira toriyama had to  address it in a statement on the  official japanese twitter account for  dragon ball super toriyama said gohan is  actually stronger than anyone or so it  said but lately he hasn't really gotten  a chance to shine in order to motivate  gohan it takes his revered teacher  piccolo rather than his father goku i  figured i'd try giving birth to a new  superhero by putting these two in the  spotlight to their intense battles with  the gamma androids this really is a  return to form for gohan who in dragon  ball z was considered one of the  strongest fighters alive goku and vegeta  have absolutely dominated the power  rankings of dragon ball super with their  recently acquired god powers but it  seems that with gohan's latest  transformation he once again has  currently the highest level of power  currently possible in the dragon ball  franchise
 

